                        <div class="mx-auto mt-12 max-w-220">
                            <h3>Rapid prototyping with React and Codex.</h3>
                            <p class="mt-8">
                                Rather than stopping at static Figma screens, I
                                built a functional prototype in React to test
                                the interaction model in a more realistic
                                environment. Codex helped me move faster by
                                supporting mock data setup and interaction
                                implementation, making it possible to recreate a
                                testable experience in a short timeframe.
